Hi Florian,

Could we meet at 10 on Monday, 17 November, to work through the twenty refere=
nces in the attached exercise? They come from the source notes to the revised=
 chapter.

Please open each reference independently first and locate the passage in its =
surrounding lines. A search result in the transcription file can help you fin=
d a place, but it cannot stand in for opening the source. If a candidate look=
s doubtful, leave it as written and note why rather than changing it ahead of=
 our comparison.

We can put the uncertain ones side by side before anything goes back into the=
 working chapter.

Thanks,
Judith

